stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Received
  Received --> Rejected: authentication or request policy fails
  Received --> Validated: request and feature contract pass
  Validated --> Rejected: missing, unknown, nonnumeric or incompatible input
  Validated --> ArtifactReady: governed artifact and policy load
  ArtifactReady --> Rejected: artifact unavailable or incompatible
  ArtifactReady --> DecisionComputed: finite score and stable explanation evidence
  DecisionComputed --> ReviewPath: approved degraded-review policy applies
  DecisionComputed --> AuditCommitted: required audit evidence acknowledged
  AuditCommitted --> Responded
  AuditCommitted --> Rejected: durable audit requirement fails
  ReviewPath --> AuditCommitted
  Responded --> [*]
  Rejected --> [*]

  note right of ArtifactReady
    Current code checks file availability.
    Signature, digest, approval and schema gates
    are target production controls.
  end note
